            ^"Uncertain Readings" LIST OF STRING ["8. Dar al-Nadwa (House of Counsel): the C of Counsel carries a mark like a cedilla (Çounsel) -- a blemish in the art or a misprint", "1220: printed between dashes (-1220-)"]
